title:"A visual introduction to the world of events.",
subtitle:"A curated visual showcase of event formats and learning themes.",
intro:"The images on this page are illustrative stock photography used to communicate the range of event environments discussed in the course. They are not presented as Anugraha-managed events or student work.",
